 "description": "Compute 1\u201312 ideal fixed/free membrane modes for a simple polygon in metres using bounded P1 finite elements. Return upper bounds, extrapolated estimates and optional frequencies/shapes. Finite spectral agreement does not prove isospectrality; no damping. CPU, direct-only; no planner binding.",
